<heading>grants account remove - Revoke a permission from an account.</heading>

<rule/>

<heading level="2">
Usage
</heading>

<pre>
  remove NAME PATH
</pre>

<heading level="2">
Description
</heading>

<paragraph>
Removes a previously granted permission from an account.
The account loses access to the specified action.
</paragraph>

<heading level="2">
Examples
</heading>

<pre>
remove admin /crm/contact/edit
  Remove the admin account's /crm/contact/edit permission.
</pre>

<heading level="2">
See also
</heading>

<paragraph>
account/show, account/add, group/remove, path/show
</paragraph>
